@ZombieKidzRule
Thanks a lot for the advice and encouragement! I have been having fun with the engine, and it's been nice to join the forum and see other people's work.
It might be too late for me to switch to MV for this project because I really don't want to remake everything I've finished, but if that's the case then I think I'll scrap my plans for a game to figure out the combat system for 2K3 and do that with MV instead.
